      "tool": "in-app-browser",
      "viewports": [390, 768, 1440],
      "horizontalOverflow": false,
      "consoleErrors": 0,
      "note": "Chess and 2048 panels switch exclusively by click and ArrowLeft/ArrowRight; roving tabindex, qualification labels, drill-through links, and responsive layouts were inspected. One hidden-panel CSS defect was found in the first pass, fixed, and recaptured."
